      "title": "Understanding \"Keys\"",
      "sourceHash": "18d86dc40c1f7d53288ae3a3acd66301d8c14e77688754740e18e9fc4cd257f8",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.133,
          "end": 5,
          "en": "- [Narrator] So why are we getting this key warning?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5,
          "end": 8.2,
          "en": "After all it looks like everything works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.2,
          "end": 10.833,
          "en": "Well React has a special concept when it comes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.833,
          "end": 13,
          "en": "to rendering lists of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13,
          "end": 16.3,
          "en": "a concept which exists to ensure that React is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.3,
          "end": 20.866,
          "en": "able to update and render such lists efficiently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.866,
          "end": 25.133,
          "en": "without performance losses, or bugs, which may occur.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.133,
          "end": 25.533,
          "en": "without performance losses, or bugs, which may occur.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.533,
          "end": 28.9,
          "en": "And I wanna show you which problem we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.9,
          "end": 30.933,
          "en": "with the current implementation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.133,
          "end": 34.2,
          "en": "If you have a look at your Developer Tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.2,
          "end": 37.333,
          "en": "and you go to the Elements tab, there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.333,
          "end": 39.566,
          "en": "you can inspect your",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.566,
          "end": 42.7,
          "en": "your list here, which is this list of div's.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.7,
          "end": 42.766,
          "en": "your list here, which is this list of div's.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.766,
          "end": 46.133,
          "en": "We could change this to a list with list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.133,
          "end": 49.866,
          "en": "but for the moment, I'll stick to these div's here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.866,
          "end": 52.466,
          "en": "And if we now have a look at this list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.466,
          "end": 52.533,
          "en": "And if we now have a look at this list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.533,
          "end": 54.933,
          "en": "then you should watch the part here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.933,
          "end": 57.6,
          "en": "on the right in Developer Tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.6,
          "end": 59.966,
          "en": "as I add a new item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.966,
          "end": 60.433,
          "en": "as I add a new item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.433,
          "end": 62.166,
          "en": "A book 2, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.166,
          "end": 64.566,
          "en": "for 39.99",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 64.566,
          "end": 65.966,
          "en": "if I add dat,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 65.966,
          "end": 67.966,
          "en": "watch these div's on the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 69.466,
          "end": 70.866,
          "en": "Did you see what happened?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 70.866,
          "end": 72.5,
          "en": "This last item flashed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 72.5,
          "end": 73.166,
          "en": "And if our item flashes here, it means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 73.166,
          "end": 75.666,
          "en": "And if our item flashes here, it means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 75.666,
          "end": 77.7,
          "en": "that it was edited",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 77.7,
          "end": 80.566,
          "en": "or added by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 80.566,
          "end": 81.43299999999999,
          "en": "or added by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 81.43299999999999,
          "end": 83.93299999999999,
          "en": "Now it's strange that the last item flashed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 83.93299999999999,
          "end": 85.866,
          "en": "because actually the new item was added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 85.866,
          "end": 89.9,
          "en": "as the first item, the top most item in this list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.9,
          "end": 91.7,
          "en": "to understand what's going on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 91.7,
          "end": 94.366,
          "en": "Let me expand this first item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 94.366,
          "end": 95.96600000000001,
          "en": "A book 2, which I just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 95.96600000000001,
          "end": 98.333,
          "en": "And let me add a third item here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 100.033,
          "end": 100.93299999999999,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 100.93299999999999,
          "end": 103.866,
          "en": "Let's add this and click Add Expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 103.866,
          "end": 105.233,
          "en": "and you see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 105.233,
          "end": 106.8,
          "en": "this also flashed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 106.8,
          "end": 109.76599999999999,
          "en": "if not rewind and go back a couple of seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 109.76599999999999,
          "end": 112.6,
          "en": "And you'll see that this h2 tag of the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 112.6,
          "end": 113.96600000000001,
          "en": "first item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 113.96600000000001,
          "end": 117.3,
          "en": "also flashed when I added this new item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 117.3,
          "end": 120.833,
          "en": "So what actually happens here when I add a new item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 120.833,
          "end": 124.233,
          "en": "is that React, renders this new item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 124.233,
          "end": 127.633,
          "en": "as the last item in this list of div's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 127.633,
          "end": 131.2,
          "en": "and updates all items and replace their content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 131.2,
          "end": 132.3,
          "en": "such that it again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 132.3,
          "end": 135.666,
          "en": "matches the order of the items in my Array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 135.666,
          "end": 136.4,
          "en": "matches the order of the items in my Array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 136.4,
          "end": 139.03300000000002,
          "en": "And this is not great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 139.03300000000002,
          "end": 139.3,
          "en": "And this is not great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 139.3,
          "end": 140.266,
          "en": "This is happening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 140.266,
          "end": 143.633,
          "en": "because to React all these items look similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 143.633,
          "end": 146.5,
          "en": "and it only sees that my Array changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 146.5,
          "end": 148.7,
          "en": "that it's now longer than before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 148.7,
          "end": 149,
          "en": "that it's now longer than before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 149,
          "end": 151.8,
          "en": "And hence it simply renders an additional div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 151.8,
          "end": 153.7,
          "en": "and it adds that at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 153.7,
          "end": 153.833,
          "en": "and it adds that at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 153.833,
          "end": 156.3,
          "en": "And then it simply walks through all the items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 156.3,
          "end": 159.733,
          "en": "and updates the content inside of every item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 159.733,
          "end": 161.7,
          "en": "to match the Array content again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 163.03300000000002,
          "end": 165.9,
          "en": "The final result, therefore is correct here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 169.6,
          "en": "but from a performance perspective this is not great",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 169.6,
          "end": 173.233,
          "en": "because all items are visited and updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 173.233,
          "end": 175.8,
          "en": "and it can even lead to bugs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 175.8,
          "end": 178.833,
          "en": "If the expense items would be state full items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 178.833,
          "end": 181.866,
          "en": "and we would have some state managed inside of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 181.866,
          "end": 182.333,
          "en": "and we would have some state managed inside of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 182.333,
          "end": 185.533,
          "en": "Then if, for example, our first item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 185.533,
          "end": 188.266,
          "en": "if it has a certain state if we add a new item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 188.266,
          "end": 190.433,
          "en": "the old first item would be overwritten",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 190.433,
          "end": 192.266,
          "en": "with the new first item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 192.266,
          "end": 192.5,
          "en": "with the new first item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 192.5,
          "end": 195.833,
          "en": "Hence any state changes we might've had in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 195.833,
          "end": 197.066,
          "en": "would be lost.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 197.066,
          "end": 199.53300000000002,
          "en": "So besides potential performance issues",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 199.53300000000002,
          "end": 201.466,
          "en": "we could also run into bugs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 202.9,
          "end": 204.7,
          "en": "So that is a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 204.7,
          "end": 206.3,
          "en": "And the question therefore is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 206.3,
          "end": 209.433,
          "en": "why does React, behave like this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 209.433,
          "end": 212.4,
          "en": "The answer is because it has no other way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 212.4,
          "end": 212.666,
          "en": "The answer is because it has no other way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 212.666,
          "end": 214.933,
          "en": "It currently simply checks the length",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 214.933,
          "end": 217.1,
          "en": "of the Array and then has a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 217.1,
          "end": 219.6,
          "en": "at the number of items that were already rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 220.53300000000002,
          "end": 224.266,
          "en": "The individual items all look similar to React though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 224.266,
          "end": 227.666,
          "en": "so it can't know where a new item should be added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 227.666,
          "end": 229.066,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 230.466,
          "end": 233.36599999999999,
          "en": "That's why we get this warning because we have a way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 233.36599999999999,
          "end": 236.86599999999999,
          "en": "of telling react where a new item it should be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 236.86599999999999,
          "end": 237.066,
          "en": "of telling react where a new item it should be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 237.066,
          "end": 239.666,
          "en": "And we do that by going to the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 239.666,
          "end": 242.133,
          "en": "where we output our list of items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 242.133,
          "end": 242.366,
          "en": "where we output our list of items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 242.366,
          "end": 244.266,
          "en": "So does map method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 244.266,
          "end": 248.6,
          "en": "and we then add a special prop to this item here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 248.6,
          "end": 248.933,
          "en": "and we then add a special prop to this item here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 248.933,
          "end": 251.36599999999999,
          "en": "And that's the key prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 251.36599999999999,
          "end": 251.8,
          "en": "And that's the key prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 251.8,
          "end": 255.7,
          "en": "This is not a prop we are using instead of expense item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 255.7,
          "end": 259.633,
          "en": "but instead it's a prop you can add to any component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 259.633,
          "end": 259.83299999999997,
          "en": "but instead it's a prop you can add to any component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 259.83299999999997,
          "end": 262.666,
          "en": "no matter if it's a custom component by you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 262.666,
          "end": 267.733,
          "en": "or if it's a built in HTML element, you can always add this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 267.733,
          "end": 268.033,
          "en": "or if it's a built in HTML element, you can always add this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 268.033,
          "end": 270.733,
          "en": "And if you do add it, if you add the key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 270.733,
          "end": 273.7,
          "en": "to your component or HTML element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 273.7,
          "end": 275.433,
          "en": "then you can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 275.433,
          "end": 279.433,
          "en": "help React identify the individual items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 279.433,
          "end": 280.166,
          "en": "help React identify the individual items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 280.166,
          "end": 282.966,
          "en": "For dat you need to set a unique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 282.966,
          "end": 285.9,
          "en": "value per list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 285.9,
          "end": 288.033,
          "en": "and dat, for example in this case here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 288.033,
          "end": 289.733,
          "en": "would be the expense ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 291.33299999999997,
          "end": 293.433,
          "en": "because in our expenses Array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 293.433,
          "end": 295.9,
          "en": "every item has a unique ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 297.366,
          "end": 300.766,
          "en": "And if you wonder what you do, if you have no unique ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 300.766,
          "end": 304.1,
          "en": "then you could use the second argument which you get here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 304.1,
          "end": 306.466,
          "en": "for the function you pass to map",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 306.466,
          "end": 309.066,
          "en": "which is an automatically managed index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 309.066,
          "end": 312.5,
          "en": "though it's discouraged to use that since with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 312.5,
          "end": 315.166,
          "en": "you can still run into bugs because the index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 315.166,
          "end": 317.6,
          "en": "for a given item is always the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 317.6,
          "end": 321.8,
          "en": "and not directly attached to the content of the item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 321.8,
          "end": 322.33299999999997,
          "en": "and not directly attached to the content of the item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 322.33299999999997,
          "end": 323.933,
          "en": "For the ID that's different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 323.933,
          "end": 328.566,
          "en": "every item with a certain content has a clear unique ID.",
